[
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P1-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P1-S1",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "A history of long and effortless success can be a dreadful handicap, but, if properly handled, it may become a driving force.",
    "translation": "长期不费吹灰之力取得成功的历史可能是一个可怕的障碍，但如果处理得当，它可能会成为一种推动力。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P1-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P1-S2",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "When the United States entered just such a glowing period after the end of the Second World War, it had a market eight times larger than any competitor, giving its industries unparalleled economies of scale.",
    "translation": "当美国在第二次世界大战结束后进入如此辉煌​​的时期时，它的市场规模是任何竞争对手的八倍，使其产业具有无与伦比的规模经济。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P1-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P1-S3",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Its scientists were the world's best; its workers the most skilled.",
    "translation": "它的科学家是世界上最优秀的；它的工人是最熟练的。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P1-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P1-S4",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "America and Americans were prosperous beyond the dreams of the Europeans and Asians whose economies the war had destroyed.",
    "translation": "美国和美国人的繁荣超出了欧洲人和亚洲人的梦想，他们的经济被战争摧毁了。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P1-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P1-S5",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "It was inevitable that this primacy should have narrowed as other countries grew richer.",
    "translation": "随着其他国家变得更加富裕，这种主导地位不可避免地会缩小。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 6,
      "ps": "P1-S6"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 6,
      "id": "P1-S6",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Just as inevitably, the retreat from predominance proved painful.",
    "translation": "同样不可避免的是，从主导地位的退却也被证明是痛苦的。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 7,
      "ps": "P1-S7"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 7,
      "id": "P1-S7",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "By the mid-1980s Americans had found themselves at a loss over their fading industrial competitiveness.",
    "translation": "到 20 世纪 80 年代中期，美国人发现自己因工业竞争力下降而不知所措。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P2-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P2-S1",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Some huge American industries, such as consumer electronics, had shrunk or vanished in the face of foreign competition.",
    "translation": "美国一些大型产业，例如消费电子产品，在外国竞争面前已经萎缩或消失。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P2-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P2-S2",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "By 1987 there was only one American television maker left, Zenith. (Now there is none: Zenith was bought by South Korea's LG Electronics in July.) Foreign-made cars and textiles were sweeping into the domestic market.",
    "translation": "到 1987 年，美国只剩下一家电视制造商：Zenith。 （现在已经没有了：Zenith 于 7 月份被韩国 LG 电子收购。） 外国制造的汽车和纺织品正在席卷国内市场。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P2-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P2-S3",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "America's machine-tool industry was on the ropes.",
    "translation": "美国的机床工业陷入困境。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P2-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P2-S4",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "For a while it looked as though the making of semiconductors, which America had invented and which sat at the heart of the new computer age, was going to be the next casualty.",
    "translation": "有一段时间，美国发明并处于新计算机时代核心地位的半导体制造似乎将成为下一个受害者。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P2-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P2-S5",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "All of this caused a crisis of confidence.",
    "translation": "所有这些都引发了信任危机。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 6,
      "ps": "P2-S6"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 6,
      "id": "P2-S6",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Americans stopped taking prosperity for granted.",
    "translation": "美国人不再认为繁荣是理所当然的。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 7,
      "ps": "P2-S7"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 7,
      "id": "P2-S7",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "They began to believe that their way of doing business was failing, and that their incomes would therefore shortly begin to fall as well.",
    "translation": "他们开始相信他们的经营方式正在失败，因此他们的收入很快也会开始下降。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P3-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P3-S1",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "The mid-1980s brought one inquiry after another into the causes of America's industrial decline.",
    "translation": "20 世纪 80 年代中期，人们对美国工业衰退的原因进行了一次又一次的调查。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P3-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P3-S2",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Their sometimes sensational findings were filled with warnings about the growing competition from overseas.",
    "translation": "他们有时令人震惊的发现充满了对来自海外日益激烈的竞争的警告。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P3-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P3-S3",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "How things have changed!",
    "translation": "事情发生了多么大的变化啊！",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P3-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P3-S4",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "In 1995 the United States can look back on five years of solid growth while Japan has been struggling.",
    "translation": "1995年，美国可以实现五年的稳健增长，而日本却一直在苦苦挣扎。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P3-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P3-S5",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Few Americans attribute this solely to such obvious causes as a devalued dollar or the turning of the business cycle.",
    "translation": "很少有美国人将这仅仅归因于美元贬值或商业周期转变等明显原因。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 6,
      "ps": "P3-S6"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 6,
      "id": "P3-S6",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Self-doubt has yielded to blind pride.",
    "translation": "自我怀疑已经屈服于盲目的骄傲。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
